          "author_name": "@andreash7920",
          "author_url": "http://www.youtube.com/@andreash7920",
          "text": "But engineering and solving problems is fun and satisfying, managing is not, to me. Otherwise I would want to be a manager not an engineer.",
          "like_count": 2,
